<title>USA: Crown Casino Corp FY full results.</title>
<headline>Crown Casino Corp FY full results.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended</p>
<p>								 April 30,</p>
<p>							   1997	  1996</p>
<p>Results of Operations:</p>
<p> Revenues					   $    --     $    --</p>
<p> Net income					   8,860	12,299</p>
<p> Earnings per Share				   .80	  1.03</p>
<p>								 April 30,</p>
<p>							   1997	  1996</p>
<p>Balance Sheet Data:</p>
<p> Cash						  21,118	   669</p>
<p> Other current assets			    15,533	   792</p>
<p> Total assets					38,237	39,329</p>
<p> Stockholders' equity			    35,713	30,153</p>
<p> Shares outstanding				10,395	11,651</p>
<p>The operating results for the year ended April 30, 1997 include (i) a pretax gain of $14.9 million from the sale of the Company's remaining 50% interest in St. Charles Gaming Company, Inc. (&quot;SCGC&quot;), and (ii) a $5.3 million loss from the sale of certain securities received in the sale of its interests in SCGC.</p>
<p>The operating results for the year ended April 30, 1996 include (i) a pretax gain of $21.5 million from the sale of the first 50% interest in SCGC, and (ii) a $2.4 million loss representing the Company's equity in the net loss of SCGC.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
